
Code and procedure from: https://github.com/rai-opensource/vlfm

Updated the dockerfile by adding these two lines at the end in order to make it work with vlfm:
  ENV PYTHONPATH="/workspace/vlfm:${PYTHONPATH:-}"
  WORKDIR /workspace/vlfm

#build docker
docker build -t dcon_habitat_vlfm .

#run docker
docker run --gpus all -it \
    -v $(pwd)/vlfm:/workspace/vlfm \
    --name vlfm_dev \
    dcon_habitat_vlfm

#installed vlfm without the extra habitat dependencies
cd /workspace/vlfm
pip install -e .

